<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Corpus</title>
<style data-mdp="theme">/* THEME_CSS redacted */</style>
<style data-mdp="shell">/* SHELL_CSS redacted */</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="mdp-document">
<h1>Document Title</h1>
<p>A paragraph with <strong>strong</strong>, <em>emphasis</em>, <del>strikethrough</del>, <code>inline code</code>, and
a <a href="#document-title" rel="noopener noreferrer">link to a heading</a>. An autolink: <a href="https://example.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://example.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Lists</h2>
<p>Unordered:</p>
<ul>
<li>First</li>
<li>Second
<ul>
<li>Nested</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Third</li>
</ul>
<p>Ordered:</p>
<ol>
<li>One</li>
<li>Two</li>
<li>Three</li>
</ol>
<p>Task list:</p>
<ul>
<li><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> Not done</li>
<li><input type="checkbox" checked="" disabled=""> Done</li>
</ul>
<h2>Blockquote</h2>
<blockquote>
<p>A quote spanning
two lines.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2>Table</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="left">Fruit</th>
<th align="center">Count</th>
<th align="right">Price</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="left">Apples</td>
<td align="center">3</td>
<td align="right">1.50</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left">Pears</td>
<td align="center">12</td>
<td align="right">4.00</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Fenced code</h2>
<pre><code class="language-rust">fn main() {
    println!("hello");
}
</code></pre>
<h2>Alert</h2>
<div class="markdown-alert markdown-alert-warning">
<p class="markdown-alert-title">Warning</p>
<p>Be careful here.</p>
</div>
<h2>Footnote</h2>
<p>This claim needs a source.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-src" id="fnref-src" rel="noopener noreferrer">1</a></sup></p>
<section class="footnotes">
<ol>
<li id="fn-src">
<p>The supporting reference. <a href="#fnref-src" class="footnote-backref" rel="noopener noreferrer">↩</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
</main>
<script data-mdp="shell">/* SHELL_JS redacted */</script>
</body>
</html>
